org_test.org and org_bank_test.wdb were generated by tests/m3/fixtures/gen_org_test.py (row I703): an original 20 s Organya
Org-02 song (three melody voices, two drum voices) and a square-wave soundbank with silent drums. Both are original to this
project and released as CC0. No Cave Story data is used; wave100.wdb (Studio Pixel) is not redistributable and is not shipped.
